  m_text: "These games are somewhat related to arcade video games, but what makes
    them stand out is not only their racing genre, but their dedicated driver controls.
    For car racing games, players can expect to find a car-like set up complete with
    a driver\u2019s seat, steering wheel, and gas/brake pedals. For bike racing games,
    players can hop onto plastic motorcycles. This allows the player to feel like
    they\u2019re really driving."
