  m_text: 'Another classic arcade game, the exact mechanics of dance games can differ
    game-by-game, but all of them share a common goal of having the player perform
    actions to the beat of music, whether it be stepping on arrow panels or tapping
    at screens. Some notable examples include Dance Dance Revolution and Guitar Hero. '
